---
alwaysApply: true
---

Whenver a JIRA ticker is asked to be solved
1. Read the ticket - read the description, image link (design), confluence link(functionality)
2. Create a new branch following standard naming conventions
4. For UI related read the description for design image link and also functionality(confluence link)
6. Strictly Use the design-analyzer subagent to analyze design [image URL]
7. Develop the feature as per rules and show it to the user in browser, repeat until user feels satisfied
8. Once the user is satisfied commit the changes with proper conventions and raise PR and give the user the link of the PR, move the jira ticket to next positive state and print the newer status of the ticket, attach whatever related links useful for the user